{"ref":"BDB, נְדִיבָה","hw":"נְדִיבָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. nobility, nobleness</strong>;—sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִבָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:15\" href=\"/Job.30.15\">Jb 30:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.8\">Is 32:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>nobility</em> of rank, <em>honour</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 30:15\" href=\"/Job.30.15\">Jb 30:15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  pl. = <em>noble things</em> as counselled by the <span dir=\"rtl\">נדיב</span> in character <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.8\">Is 32:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>.","next":"BDB, נוֹדָ֑ב","prev":"BDB, נָדִיב"}